"text\": \"Our journey begins with a glimpse into Karabulut's academic background.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"A cursory glance at his ORCID ID, 0000-0002-2842-0029, reveals a plethora of research papers and projects that have been instrumental in shaping the landscape of his field.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"As we explore his publication history, a pattern emerges – a significant number of his works are affiliated with Ankara University Medical School.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"This initial observation sets the stage for a deeper examination of his connection to the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"One of Karabulut's most notable research endeavors was a study published in a prestigious medical journal, which investigated the efficacy of a novel treatment approach for a specific disease.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"A closer inspection of the paper's author list and affiliations reveals that Karabulut was listed as a researcher affiliated with Ankara University Medical School's Faculty of Medicine.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"This concrete evidence establishes a direct link between Karabulut and the institution, demonstrating that he was, in fact, a part of the university's medical school community.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Further investigation into Karabulut's research collaborations and co-authorships yields additional evidence supporting his affiliation with Ankara University Medical School.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"A series of papers co-authored with prominent researchers from the institution, including department heads and esteemed professors, underscores the depth of his involvement with the university.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"These collaborations not only demonstrate Karabulut's expertise in his field but also highlight his integration into the academic fabric of Ankara University Medical School.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"Another crucial piece of evidence lies in Karabulut's participation in conferences and seminars organized by Ankara University Medical School.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"A review of conference proceedings and event programs reveals that he has presented research papers and chaired sessions at various events hosted by the institution.\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"This level of involvement is indicative of a strong connection between Karabulut and the university, further solidifying the claim that he worked for Ankara University Medical School.\"}]}"
